  "notes": "P0-32 close-out C: Done notes for nine old issues, with focused tests re-run at the base commit (int 60d0255c4, the parent of this branch). Local run on macOS 26.6.2 arm64, not CI. Non-zero exits: the two git grep commands for \"scoring failed|Could not load question sets\" in tests and \"build:workspace\" in src exit 1 because nothing matched, which is the recorded finding (no score-router 500 test; no stale build:workspace message). The quick release gate passed 16/16 executed checks and skipped 5 by design (packed-install, full-test-suite, per-file-coverage, install-persona-qa, live-deploy-health); installed acceptance comes from P0-31, not from this gate. tests are the sum of the eleven focused vitest runs in focused-tests.json, not the full suite. The gh commands are read-only. No original from the untracked research folder was read or copied; the three reconciliation summaries come from candidate commit 37c1466b via git show."
